{"title":"Argentina mathematics competitions","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Argentina_Mathematics_Competitions\">Argentina Mathematics Competitions</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Argentina_mathematics_competitions&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Argentina Mathematics Competitions\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>The <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://oma.org.ar\">Olimpíada Matemática Argentina</a> hosts many of the major Argentinian contests.</li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://oma.org.ar/enunciados\">Full problem sets in Spanish</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Resources\">Resources</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Argentina_mathematics_competitions&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Resources\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mathematics_competitions\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Mathematics competitions\">Mathematics competitions</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mathematics_competition_resources\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Mathematics competition resources\">Mathematics competition resources</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Math_books\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Math books\">Math books</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mathematics_scholarships\" title=\"Mathematics scholarships\"> Math scholarships</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018073431\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.006 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.007 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 5/10000